"><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></msup><mi>ln</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mstyle></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
